"They say your pet was once a priest..."



If you're bothered by cursed items, try keeping your pet around and
letting it try walking on the items first.  If it doesn't touch them,
neither should you.

This probably won't make the game that much easier, but at least you
shouldn't get killed by cursed items.  BTW, all items in a ghost's
pile are cursed; don't bother spreading it out and letting Rover test them.

If it bores you too much to do this, play a priest (automatic knowledge
of blessed/cursed state of items), and remember to KICK killer bees if
you don't have... oh say, a +3 blessed warhammer named Mjollnir.

